    + Fix ConstantPoolModuleAccessTest failures on Java 25
    + 377: Fix testing on Java 24 and up
  * Changes
    + Bump org.apache.commons:commons-parent from 72 to 89
    + Bump org.apache.commons:commons-lang3 from 3.14.0 to 3.19.0
    + Bump org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-stdlib from 2.0.0 to 2.2.20
